.TH OSC52 1 "August 2026" "osc52 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
osc52 \- copy and paste using OSC 52
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B osc52
.I command
.RI [ arguments ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B osc52
copies to and pastes from a terminal clipboard using OSC 52 escape sequences.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B copy [TEXT...]
Copy arguments, or standard input when no arguments are provided.
.TP
.B paste
Query the terminal clipboard and print its contents.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Show usage information.
.TP
.BR -v , " --version"
Show the version number.
